  "question": "Each Facebook user can designate a personal email address, a business email address, and a recovery email address.\n\nUnfortunately, the table is currently in the wrong format, so you need to transform its structure to show the following columns (see example output): user id, personal email, business email, and recovery email. Sort your answer by user id in ascending order.",
